SEO Implementation Summary for VOX Digital Agency

This file contains a comprehensive summary of all SEO elements implemented across the website.

Sheet 1: H1 Tags
| Page/Location | H1 Content | Type |
|--------------|------------|------|
| components/home/hero.tsx | Engineering High-Performance Digital Platforms | Hero H1 |
| components/shared/page-hero.tsx | {title} (dynamic) | Dynamic H1 |
| app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx | {post.meta.title} (blog post title) | Blog H1 |
| app/portfolio/[slug]/page.tsx | Dynamic study title | Portfolio H1 |
| app/services/[slug]/page.tsx | {service.name} (service name) | Service H1 |
| app/coming-soon/page.tsx | Something exceptional is on the way | Coming Soon H1 |
| app/error.tsx | Something glitched. | Error H1 |
| app/not-found.tsx | This page left the build. | 404 H1 |

