Sheet 8: Structured Data (JSON-LD)
| Type | Pages | Key Fields |
|------|-------|-----------|
| Organization | Home, About, Services, Contact | name, url, logo, email, sameAs (LinkedIn, X, Instagram), contactPoint |
| Service | Service detail pages | @type: "Service", serviceType, name, description, provider, url |
| Article | Blog detail pages | @type: "Article", headline, description, datePublished, author, publisher, image |
| BreadcrumbList | Pages with breadcrumbs | @type: "BreadcrumbList", itemListElement with position, name, item |

